        "title": "He araguang poubaumei Jehovah",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. He Araguang pubaumei Jehovah,",
            "Seitan %&6 ata kanglou bam khou hei;",
            "Nang njianloumei nang lat pan khou %&6,",
            "Thuak pat lou the tuna guang salou o.",
            "Nang %&6 njianmei lat kang hei,",
            "Alung %&6 mu lakge poubaumei;",
            "Tingkauh le kandihmei nun %&6.",
            "",
            "2. He pubaumei nang suiahiam daimei ta,",
            "Jat kathui %&6 nthuknga ning bam diu;",
            "Alau kumma kapma huai bam khou hei,",
            "Nang ramgai tei akhou naguang lou o.",
            "He Jisu hei akhang ethei,",
            "Baimei kahao nicho poubaumei;",
            "Kagan thui akhange Jisu.",
            "",
            "3. Tingkum chinghching neilamei phu jaoki,",
            "Ariu makge jingmei bam rana de;",
            "Kandih neilamei le tikgun daimei,",
            "Phu tou sini kagan tingsang mak ge.",
            "Akhang mu Jisu nang na de,",
            "Tingkum machang khang gai nbu hai hai,",
            "Kauh le dih khou kungliangmei e."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
